  "cell_contents": "One NaMg2Al5SiO12 formula unit per conventional hexagonal P63/m cell (Z=1). Kawai and Tsuchiya used a 1x1x3 ordered supercell containing 63 atoms, hence three such conventional cells. The stored crystallographic model is an explicitly identified CaMg2Al6O12 topology proxy and does not represent the calculated cation ordering.",
