  "notes": "The lattice, coordinates, elements, and occupancies are transcribed without modification from Miura et al.'s CaMg2Al6O12 refinement and are present only as an isostructural topology proxy. They are not NaMg2Al5SiO12 coordinates and do not encode any of Kawai and Tsuchiya's eight ordered Na/vacancy or Al/Si configurations. No target occupancies or averaged coordinates are invented. The executable EOS V0, rather than this proxy lattice, defines the target phase's zero-pressure volume.",
